# expect: accept
# Negative scale: -4 x (+/-1 V) + 2 gives ends 6 and -2, so the channel measures [-2, 6].
# The alarm sits exactly at both ends.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 1 -> 1*95 = 95 bit/s; groups m9g0@50
# CAN: sum of group rates 50 Hz -> 50*135 = 6750 bit/s; total 6845 bit/s = 1.369 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 50 Hz -> 0.5 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*0.5 + 1*(22+4+66) = 96.5 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 77200 bit/s (limit 2000000)
iqk-plan 1
campaign blind1_c01
channel inv aam:9:1 rate=50 range_mv=1000 scale=-4 offset=2 unit=mm alarm=-2,6
